# N-Methyl-2-pyrrolidone (NMP): gas-phase-guess Opt + Freq with CPCM solvation
#
# NOTE ON SOLVENT NAME: unlike ethanol/acetone/DMF/benzene/etc., NMP does not
# appear with confidence in ORCA's built-in named SMD solvent list (could not
# verify "nmp" / "n-methylpyrrolidone" / "n-methyl-2-pyrrolidone" as a
# recognized keyword). To avoid a repeat of the earlier DMF/XTB2 keyword
# error, this uses plain CPCM with an EXPLICITLY specified dielectric
# constant and refractive index instead of relying on a named-solvent
# keyword - this syntax is guaranteed valid regardless of whether NMP is in
# ORCA's named list.
#   epsilon (dielectric constant) = 32.2
#   refrac  (refractive index)    = 1.468
# (both are standard literature values for NMP at ~20-25 C)
# This does NOT include the SMD-specific non-electrostatic (CDS) term with
# NMP-specific surface-tension/H-bonding parameters - only the CPCM
# electrostatic (dielectric) contribution. If the full SMD CDS term is
# needed for NMP specifically, that requires additional solvent descriptors
# (Abraham's alpha/beta, macroscopic surface tension, aromatic/halogen
# fractions) that would need to be looked up and entered via a %smd block.
#
# Starting geometry: idealized regular-pentagon-based guess for the
# pyrrolidone ring (N-C(=O)-CH2-CH2-CH2-, closing back to N) plus the
# N-methyl group; bond lengths/angles are only approximate and will relax
# substantially during optimization.

! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF Opt Freq KeepDens CPCM

%cpcm
  epsilon 32.2
  refrac  1.468
end

* xyz 0 1
N     0.000000    1.276000    0.000000
C    -1.213000    0.394000    0.000000
C    -0.750000   -1.032000    0.000000
C     0.750000   -1.032000    0.000000
C     1.213000    0.394000    0.000000
O    -2.373000    0.771000    0.000000
C     0.000000    2.746000    0.000000
H     1.028000    3.109000    0.000000
H    -0.514000    3.109000    0.890000
H    -0.514000    3.109000   -0.890000
H    -1.162000   -1.598000    0.750000
H    -1.162000   -1.598000   -0.750000
H     1.162000   -1.598000    0.750000
H     1.162000   -1.598000   -0.750000
H     1.878000    0.610000    0.750000
